{"id":"n71793-1-11","stage":3,"title":"참기름 · 香油","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71793-1-11-1","ko":"참기름을 좀 넣을까요?","zh":"要加一点香油吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"참기름을","meaning":"香油，芝麻油","explanation":"참기름：香油，芝麻油；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"참기름","audio":"/audio/2acd087e063a73d4241f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71793","senseId":"1","lemma":"참기름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣을까요?","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2acd087e063a73d4","term":"참기름","zh":"香油，芝麻油","audio":"/audio/2acd087e063a73d4241f.mp3","entryId":"71793","definition":"用芝麻压榨出来的油。","pronunciation":["참기름"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/81adea4d46515acb1341.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71793-1-11-2","ko":"너무 많이 넣으면 느끼하니까 적당히 넣어.","zh":"加太多会太油腻，适量加就好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣으면","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느끼하니까","meaning":"油腻，甜腻","explanation":"느끼하다：油腻，甜腻；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"느끼하다","audio":"/audio/e1d77341c32cacddffff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40395","senseId":"1","lemma":"느끼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적당히","meaning":"适当地","explanation":"적당히：适当地","readings":[{"term":"적당히","audio":"/audio/5fcb22b35db38ac5755f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70824","senseId":"2","lemma":"적당히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣어.","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"e1d77341c32cacdd","term":"느끼하다","zh":"油腻，甜腻","audio":"/audio/e1d77341c32cacddffff.mp3","entryId":"40395","definition":"食物油多得令人恶心。","pronunciation":["느끼하다"]},{"id":"5fcb22b35db38ac5","term":"적당히","zh":"适当地","audio":"/audio/5fcb22b35db38ac5755f.mp3","entryId":"70824","definition":"恰到好处，到不成问题的程度地。","pronunciation":["적땅히"]}],"audio":"/audio/e0eae57026ecf1b35e60.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.691,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.kore